  ("The greedy rule failed at the very first decision, since the cheap move to C led into a part of the network where every way forward cost more.", "The greedy rule failed at the very first decision. This is because the cheap move to C led into a part of the network where every way forward cost more."),
  ("The greedy algorithm has no way of knowing about costs that come later, so a late obstacle can make an early cheap-looking choice a bad one.", "The greedy algorithm has no way of knowing about costs that come later. So a late obstacle can make an early cheap-looking choice a bad one."),
